   "duration": 1.4,
   "text": "INKBORN",
   "y": -560,
   "fontSize": 104
  },
  {
   "x": 0,
   "bgColor": "#0b1a3a",
   "bgOpacity": 0.0,
   "bgPadding": 0,
   "outline": 10,
   "color": "#19c6b7",
   "fadeIn": 0.0,
   "fadeOut": 0.35,
   "start": 0.0,
   "duration": 1.4,
   "text": "THREE FILES. THAT'S THE DEMO.",
   "y": -420,
   "fontSize": 50
  },
  {
   "text": "Every day I open a Steam\ndemo and read its file\nlist. This one has three.",
   "start": 0.0,
   "duration": 4.904,
   "fontSize": 50,
   "y": 560,
   "bgOpacity": 0.62
  },
  {
   "text": "And one of them is the\nwhole game.",
   "start": 5.154,
   "duration": 2.161,
   "fontSize": 50,
   "y": 560,
   "bgOpacity": 0.62
  },
  {
   "text": "It's INKBORN. You wake\ninside a comic nobody\nfinished, and an eraser is\neating the page.",
   "start": 9.565,
   "duration": 6.263,
   "fontSize": 42,
   "y": 560,
   "bgOpacity": 0.62
  },
  {
   "text": "You carry a sketchbook.\nTrace an axe, and you're\nholding an axe. Ink is the\ncost.",
   "start": 16.078,
   "duration": 5.427,
   "fontSize": 42,
   "y": 560,
   "bgOpacity": 0.62
  },
  {
   "text": "The whole demo is a\nhundred and fifty-one\nmegabytes. Three files.",
   "start": 21.755,
   "duration": 4.434,
   "fontSize": 50,
   "y": 560,
   "bgOpacity": 0.62
  },
  {
   "text": "libgodotsteam. It's Godot.\nAfter fifteen teardowns of\nUnity and Unreal, that's\nthe first one.",
   "start": 26.439,
   "duration": 6.524,
   "fontSize": 42,
   "y": 560,
   "bgOpacity": 0.62
  },
  {
   "text": "Godot packs everything\ninside the executable. No\ndata folder, no bundles,\nnothing to read.",
   "start": 33.213,
   "duration": 6.158,
   "fontSize": 42,
   "y": 560,
   "bgOpacity": 0.62
  }
 ],
